# Audit & Deliverables

Rate every issue: 🔴 Critical · 🟠 High · 🟡 Medium · 🟢 Low

## Audit areas
1. **Architecture** — Route → Page → Hooks → Components; centralized auth
2. **Component Composition** — shadcn/shared only; shared patterns extracted
3. **State & Data** — TanStack Query; query-keys.ts; Zustand UI-only; RHF + zod
4. **Performance & UX** — Cursor pagination; skeletons; friendly errors; empty states
5. **Code Quality, Tests & A11y** — Strict TS; `pnpm test` green; accessible labels
6. **Error Handling** — per `error-handling.mdc`; error integration test exists
7. **Security** — per `security.mdc`; no secrets in code

## Required deliverables
1. Severity-ranked issues (file:line)
2. Top 3 "fix this first"
3. Component tree diagram
4. Data-flow diagram
5. One positive observation
6. Checklists: four UI states + tests run + task **Done when** verified

Verify: `pnpm exec tsc --noEmit && pnpm lint && pnpm test -- {feature}`

Be specific. No generic advice.
